// RUN: cd %corpus && ! %zomc compile --check 09-interfaces/qualified_interface_method_call_capability_neg_52.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// An interface-qualified call `A::d(p)` names its dispatch target statically
// and passes the receiver as the first argument. No receiver-call lowering
// shape accepts that form yet, so the body drains ZOM4125 with the method name
// it spells instead of reaching a missing-fact invariant.

// CHECK-LITERAL: Error [ZOM4125]: method call `d` is not supported yet
// CHECK-LITERAL:   --> conformance/09-interfaces/qualified_interface_method_call_capability_neg_52.zom:15:12
// CHECK-LITERAL:    |
// CHECK-LITERAL: 15 |     return A::d(p);
// CHECK-LITERAL:    |            ^~~~~~~
// CHECK-LITERAL: 1 error generated.
